- Signer A: short code 11111111, path m/48h/1h/0h/2h

- Signer B: short code 22222222, path m/48h/1h/0h/2h

## 8. Passphrase reminder

If the owner used an extra word (passphrase), it is not written here and never should be.

Find any extra word only where the owner stored it separately. Without the exact extra word, the recovery words can point to a different wallet.

